    "title": "Rockwell man charged with insurance fraud and unlicensed adjusting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mitch Williams ,\n1 days ago A Rockwell man is facing felony and misdemeanor charges following an investigation by the Iowa Insurance Division’s Fraud Bureau. Authorities say 39-year-old Joseph Starr was charged on March 24 with two counts of acting as a public adjuster without a license and one count of insurance fraud—presenting false information, a Class D felony. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
